to achieve price increases of upper single digits in our commercial auto line.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/11/01/the-hanover-insurance-group-inc-thg-q3-2018-earnin.aspx"},{"c":"THG 2018 Q4","e":"thg","d":"2019-01-31","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"John C. Roche","x":"We are taking additional actions to improve auto profitability and to help offset the increased severity, through price increases and various underwriting actions that Jeff will address in more detail.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/01/31/the-hanover-insurance-group-inc-thg-q4-2018-earnin.aspx"},{"c":"THG 2018 Q4","e":"thg","d":"2019-01-31","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"John C. Roche","x":"Core commercial lines pricing improved throughout the year, reaching 6% in the fourth quarter, overall core renewal price increases were led by the rate we were achieving in auto, while workers compensation pricing was pressured based on low industry losses.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/01/31/the-hanover-insurance-group-inc-thg-q4-2018-earnin.aspx"},{"c":"THG 2019 Q1","e":"thg","d":"2019-05-02","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"John C. Roche","x":"As importantly we are satisfied with the stable rate environment and price increases we are achieving across the portfolio.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/02/the-hanover-insurance-group-inc-thg-q1-2019-earnin.aspx"},{"c":"THG 2019 Q1","e":"thg","d":"2019-05-02","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"John C. Roche","x":"This includes price increases of more than 5% in each of our businesses; Personal Lines, Core Commercial and Specialty.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/02/the-hanover-insurance-group-inc-thg-q1-2019-earnin.aspx"},{"c":"THG 2019 Q2","e":"thg","d":"2019-08-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"John C. Roche","x":"Core commercial generated average price increases of 6.4%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/21/hanover-insurance-group-inc-thg-q2-2019-earnings-c.aspx"},{"c":"THG 2019 Q2","e":"thg","d":"2019-08-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John C. Roche","x":"We are investing in new underwriting and binding capabilities including business replatforming and leveraging third-party data to streamline our interactions with agents and customers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/21/hanover-insurance-group-inc-thg-q2-2019-earnings-c.aspx"},{"c":"THG 2019 Q3","e":"thg","d":"2019-10-31","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"John C. Roche","x":"In Core Commercial, the market segments we focus on continue to behave rationally and we generated average price increases of 5.5% in the quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/the-hanover-insurance-group-inc-thg-q3-2019-earnin.aspx"},{"c":"THG 2019 Q3","e":"thg","d":"2019-10-31","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Richard W. Lavey","x":"So on the Commercial Auto side, we are seeing our highest price increases here what we needed the most are 11 points in the quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/the-hanover-insurance-group-inc-thg-q3-2019-earnin.aspx"},{"c":"THG 2019 Q3","e":"thg","d":"2019-10-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John C. Roche","x":"We are incorporating robotics live chat capabilities drone technology and video collaboration tools to streamline and improve policy processing and claims handling.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/the-hanover-insurance-group-inc-thg-q3-2019-earnin.aspx"},{"c":"THG 2019 Q3","e":"thg","d":"2019-10-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jeffrey M. Farber","x":"So obviously we have got a right to continue to right-size the capital as we continue to generate it at a very rapid level.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/the-hanover-insurance-group-inc-thg-q3-2019-earnin.aspx"},{"c":"THG 2019 Q4","e":"thg","d":"2020-02-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"John C. Roche","x":"With continued price increases and strong support from our partners, we feel very good about 2020 prospects for Personal Lines and are targeting mid-single-digit growth.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/05/the-hanover-insurance-group-inc-thg-q4-2019-earnin.aspx"},{"c":"THG 2020 Q2","e":"thg","d":"2020-07-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jeffrey M. Farber","x":"These items aside, our expense ratio was relatively flat and included specific cost savings and operating efficiencies, offset by the timing of certain expenses and continued investments in our business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/29/the-hanover-insurance-group-inc-thg-q2-2020-earnin.aspx"},{"c":"THG 2020 Q3","e":"thg","d":"2020-10-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"John C. Roche","x":"Our performance reflects a focus on striking the right balance between rate and retention, while achieving price increases where we need them the most.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/28/the-hanover-insurance-group-inc-thg-q3-2020-earnin/"},{"c":"THG 2020 Q4","e":"thg","d":"2021-02-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Bryan J. Salvatore","x":"And so, we're able to now continue to drive that rate and expand our ability to capture more of that middle-market business because it's more favorable due to the price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/04/the-hanover-insurance-group-inc-thg-q4-2020-earnin/"},{"c":"THG 2020 Q4","e":"thg","d":"2021-02-04","l":"ai_disruption","r":"management","s":"John C. Roche","x":"As an account writer, we take a disciplined and long-term approach to renewal price across our home and auto policies, so as not to cause excessive disruption for customers and agents.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/04/the-hanover-insurance-group-inc-thg-q4-2020-earnin/"},{"c":"THG 2021 Q1","e":"thg","d":"2021-04-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"John C. Roche","x":"The extent of the damage highlights the need for further price increases across the U.S. property insurance market.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/30/the-hanover-insurance-group-inc-thg-q1-2021-earnin/"},{"c":"THG 2021 Q2","e":"thg","d":"2021-07-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"John C. Roche","x":"But overall, pricing in our Specialty markets has been very strong with price increases continuing to outpace loss trends.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/28/the-hanover-insurance-group-inc-thg-q2-2021-earnin/"},{"c":"THG 2021 Q2","e":"thg","d":"2021-07-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Paul Newsome","x":"And given -- I mean, 6.5% is a great number for commercial price increases, but if the inflationary levels are the 5.5% that Chubb was talking about this morning, then that margin expansion is looking smaller than it was before.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/28/the-hanover-insurance-group-inc-thg-q2-2021-earnin/"},{"c":"THG 2024 Q3","e":"thg","d":"2024-10-31","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jack Roche","x":"Excluding catastrophe losses we made significant year-over-year improvements in both Auto and Home, as a result of underwriting actions we have taken and the benefits of price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/22/hanover-thg-q3-2024-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"THG 2024 Q3","e":"thg","d":"2024-10-31","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jeff Farber","x":"The majority of the improvement however is the result of earning in very substantial price increases and to a lesser extent lower than expected auto collision loss experience, collision severity has normalized which should drive further margin improvement.","url":"